{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣女星小S（徐熙娣）近日攜熱門節目《小姐不熙娣》團隊親臨香港錄製外景特輯，展現滿滿的活力與親和力！</p><p>日前多位幸運網民在旺角街頭野生捕獲到小S身影，消息曝光後立刻引發港台兩地粉絲熱議。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;小S當天</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:25:40.787222+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:01:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:18:27.123198+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T09:18:27.123198+00:00","content_hash":"e14718241eede0208ae728acfa1803312becfaa28620de00739fd1d608a02758","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}